OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested after pedestrian
OL,4,Adies in car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old driver has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a 60-year-old man died in a
OL,8,Fcollision in Oswestry in the early
OL,9,Fhours of the morning.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,Fscene on Morda Road at about 01:00 GMT
OL,13,Fon Saturday following a report that a
OL,14,Fred Audi had struck a pedestrian, who
OL,15,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,17,FWest Mercia Police said the male driver
OL,18,Fwas held on suspicion of causing death
OL,19,Fby dangerous driving and driving while
OL,20,Funfit through drink or drugs.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
